target/

# The committed fixtures are checked in on purpose, against the root
# .gitignore's blanket `*.rastered` / `*.rindex`: the chain manifest's external
# bindings commit to these exact bytes, and `chain_stage_cli.rs` runs the chain
# straight from a clone. Regenerate with `bin/gen_input.rs` (see ../README.md),
# which also reprints the commitments to paste back into Raster.toml.
!measurements.rastered
!measurements.rindex
!threshold.rastered
!threshold.rindex
